WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.328 --> 00:00:04.844
Alright welcome to Neyland Stadium. I'm just gonna need to take a quick look through your bag, sir.

00:00:05.331 --> 00:00:07.052
Alright, lets see what we got here.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.062
Sir.

00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:12.344
You already know we have mustard in the stadium.

00:00:12.344 --> 00:00:14.504
*nervous laughter of wondering if arm strength is good enough to get a full bottle of mustard from section X2 to the field*

00:00:14.504 --> 00:00:20.017
Uhh that last time I brought that mustard we beat #12 Kentucky 24-7.

00:00:23.581 --> 00:00:25.581
Well that's just good thinking right there!

00:00:25.581 --> 00:00:27.685
We made need all the luck we can get today.

00:00:27.685 --> 00:00:30.554
hahaha Let's just see what else we got in here.

00:00:31.174 --> 00:00:32.163
Hmmmm

00:00:33.349 --> 00:00:37.717
Now these may be considered dangerous projectiles now that we got Coach Kiffin coming back.

00:00:37.717 --> 00:00:41.001
Coach...Kiffin...I"m not familiar. 

00:00:41.763 --> 00:00:46.297
I'm actually headed to Top Golf after this so just trying to save time.

00:00:48.379 --> 00:00:49.452
Makes sense!

00:00:49.452 --> 00:00:51.796
I didn't know they let you bring your own balls in there.

00:00:51.796 --> 00:00:54.627
What do you say we just breeze on through the rest of this and get you to your seat, sir.

00:00:57.101 --> 00:00:57.934
Bag of tomatoes?

00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:58.550
For my hamburger.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:00:59.477
These throwing knives?

00:00:59.477 --> 00:01:01.824
To slice the tomatoes for the..uh..hamburger.

00:01:01.824 --> 00:01:02.684
This sock full of nickles?

00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:04.482
For the vending machine on the upper deck.

00:01:15.089 --> 00:01:16.594
Now what do you need all this for?

00:01:17.388 --> 00:01:19.160
For the sun?

00:01:19.869 --> 00:01:23.510
Well I think we both know this can be squeezed into the eyes of an opposing player or coach.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.108
Not today.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:26.936
Not on my watch.

00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:30.835
You take the rest of this stuff and you get to your seat.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:32.779
But I'm keeping this.

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:39.940
Nothing gets passed me.

